{
    "background_story": "Martin was a master thief known only by his alias 'The Ghost'. His claim to fame was his uncanny ability to crack even the most secure safes, earning him the reputation as a safebreaker extraordinaire. With a keen mind and agile fingers, Martin could open a safe in minutes, often leaving behind a small note with a cryptic message. His services were in high demand by wealthy collectors and shady organizations alike. But Martin's true passion was using his skills for good, often breaking into safes to retrieve stolen artifacts or expose corrupt business dealings. His legend grew, and so did the myths surrounding him. Some said he was a former spy, while others claimed he was a vigilante. One thing was certain, however: Martin's skills as a safebreaker were unmatched, and his name was whispered in awe by those who knew of his exploits.",
